- endLine: The 1-indexed line number where the section ends (the last line before the next section heading or end of document)

## Category mapping
Map diverse heading styles to standard categories:
- SUMMARY: "Summary", "Profile", "Objective", "Professional Summary", "About Me", "Career Summary"
- EXPERIENCE: "Experience", "Work Experience", "Professional Experience", "Employment History", "Work History"
- SKILL: "Skills", "Technical Skills", "Core Competencies", "Technologies", "Tools & Technologies", "Proficiencies"
