## Positive Observations

1. **Clean architecture** -- Layout / shared / resume / pages / ui separation is well-organized
2. **File sizes** -- All 28 files under 200 lines (largest: 161 lines in data-table)
3. **Consistent patterns** -- All pages follow the same pattern: hooks at top, handlers in middle, JSX at bottom
